    "created_at": "2017-09-12T11:35:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-12T11:35:41Z",
    "body": "Gecko seems to expose an implementation detail. Why would the LF code point be converted to `<br>`? There's nothing that says that should happen.\r\n\r\nThere's also nothing that suggests typing in a `<textarea>` should modify the DOM.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
