    "created_at": "2017-09-13T07:06:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-13T07:06:04Z",
    "body": "When `<textarea>` has focus (In Gecko's word, ActiveEditingHost for `<textarea>` is available), editor inserts anonymous text node and `<br>` node into `<textarea>`.  So LF is converted to `<br>` by `Element::GetInnerHTML`.  But it has no focus, it doesn't have anonymous text node into `<textarea>`, so `Element::GetInnerHTML` returns same as Blink's behavior.   So Gecko's behavior for `textarea.innerHTML` is unexpected result by current editor implementation.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
