    "updated_at": "2017-09-14T02:04:41Z",
    "body": "web-platform-test cannot emulate keyboard operation, so we cannot write a test for some cases.  But we can add the following case.\r\n- Modifying `textarea.value` causes that `textarea.innerHTML` is updated.\r\n- `execCommand('insertText')` for `<textarea>` doesn't update `textarea.innerHTML`",
